  "story": {
    "day": 46,
    "title": "Kaya's Lunchtime Story",
    "sentences": [
      "It was lunchtime at school now.",
      "Kaya opened her lunchbox and saw eggplant.",
      "Her classmate and friend, Ken, sat next to her.",
      "Ken was a kind boy with a big book on his desk.",
      "\"What's it about?\" Kaya asked him.",
      "\"It's about toys, games, and so on!\" Ken said.",
      "Their teacher walked by. \"Everyone, enjoy!\" she smiled.",
      "Kaya remembered her dad, grandfather, and grandmother.",
      "Her aunt's wedding was a great day last month.",
      "\"Aren't these good times?\" she thought happily.",
      "Yes, this special pen was her favorite tool.",
      "Kaya hoped to go to a movie theater soon."
    ]
  }
}